      URUSBURUQACQZUQADQZGZDHCHUSUQACDSVBULCDUTUJVAUKACBTADBTUAUBUCUDULBCDUEUFU
      G $.
  $}

  $( The "distinctor" expression ` -. A. x x = y ` , stating that ` x ` and
     ` y ` are not the same variable, can be written in terms of ` F/ ` in the
