  ${
    $d x y $.
    $( Define the identity relation.  Definition 9.15 of [Quine] p. 64.  For
       example, ` 5 _I 5 ` and ` -. 4 _I 5 ` ( ~ ex-id ).  (Contributed by NM,
       13-Aug-1995.) $)
    df-id $a |- _I = { <. x , y >. | x = y } $.
