      FZGHZSDITEIJZJZBKAKUBUAJZBKAKCDELIUABEMADMUCUDABUAUBNOABCDEPUAABDEQR $.
  $}

  $( Equality theorem for Cartesian product.  (Contributed by FL,
     31-Aug-2009.) $)
