  $( Syntax for maps-to notation for functions with three arguments. $)
  cmpt3 $a class ( x e. A , y e. B , z e. C |-> D ) $.

  ${
    $d s t x $.  $d s t y $.  $d s t z $.  $d s t A $.  $d s t B $.
