    ( crdg com cres wfn wfun cdm wceq rdgfun funres ax-mp cin wss wlim rdgdmlim
    dmres limomss dfss2 mpbi eqtri df-fn mpbir2an ) BACZDEZDFUEGZUEHZDIUDGUFABJ
    DUDKLUGDUDHZMZDUDDQDUHNZUIDIUHOUJABPUHRLDUHSTUAUEDUBUC $.

  $( The initial value resulting from finite recursive definition generation.
     (Contributed by NM, 15-Oct-1996.) $)
