    ( wcel c0 crdg com cres cfv wceq peano1 fvres ax-mp rdg0g eqtrid ) ABDECAFZ
    GHIZEPIZAEGDQRJKEGPLMABCNO $.

  $( The successor value resulting from finite recursive definition generation.
     (Contributed by NM, 15-Oct-1996.)  (Revised by Mario Carneiro,
     16-Nov-2014.) $)
