      BAUISTFGEUJUKULUMUP $.
  $}

  ${
    $d f A $.  $d f B $.
    mapval.1 $e |- A e. _V $.
    mapval.2 $e |- B e. _V $.
    $( The value of set exponentiation (inference version). ` ( A ^m B ) ` is
       the set of all functions that map from ` B ` to ` A ` .  Definition
       10.24 of [Kunen] p. 24.  (Contributed by NM, 8-Dec-2003.) $)
    mapval $p |- ( A ^m B ) = { f | f : B --> A } $=
