     hierarchy of sets.  This is the class of sets of finite rank by ~ elhf2 .
     They are called the hereditarily finite sets since they are the finite
     sets whose members are hereditarily finite, as proved in ~ elhf3 .
     (Contributed by Scott Fenton, 9-Jul-2015.) $)
  df-hf $a |- Hf = U. ( R1 " _om ) $.

