       cardinality 1 (i.e. all singletons; see ~ card1 ), so that their
       ` A e. 1 ` means, in our notation, ` A e. { x | ( card `` x ) = 1o } `
       which is the same as ` A ~~ 1o ` by ~ pm54.43lem .  We do not have
       several of their earlier lemmas available (which would otherwise be
       unused by our different approach to arithmetic), so our proof is longer.
       (It is also longer because we must show every detail.)

